  "details": "Hi All,\n\nThis latest update seemed to have broken all my old avatar files.\nif you are having issues with this the steps i took to fix the issues are as follows.\n\n1. setup new unity project.\n2. import the sdk\n3 (DO NOT IMPORT YOUR OLD UNITY FILES) these seem to not upload for me probably due to old components from the prior sdk on the avatar file. make sure you drop in the .fbx and reapply dynamic bones, cloth etc.\n\nHope this helps you guys itried posting help in the discord but no one given me a role yet",
